---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | Medaase Favors" description="How Medaase Favors collects and uses your information when you order souvenirs." path="/privacy">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p><em>Draft: to be reviewed by the owner before launch.</em></p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you order, we collect your name, phone number, email address, event type and date, your delivery choice, any notes you add, and any logo or image you upload for your label.</p>
      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>We use this information only to make and deliver your order, to email you your label design and payment confirmation, and, after delivery, to ask whether you would like to leave a review.</p>
      <h2>Payments</h2>
      <p>Payments are handled by Paystack. We never see or store your card or mobile money details.</p>
      <h2>Storage</h2>
      <p>Your order details are kept in a private Google Sheet and uploaded logos in a private Google Drive folder, both accessible only to {SITE.name}.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete your information at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>On this device</h2>
      <p>We store your cart and your "turn off effects" choice in your browser so they are remembered between visits. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
